   "text": "A packet from cp-1 to the Internet:   src 192.168.122.10  --NAT #1 (host)-->  src 192.168.1.25  --NAT #2 (router)-->  your public IP\nGoing OUT works.  Coming IN does not: nothing outside the host knows that 192.168.122.0/24 exists.",
